1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,263
This Japanese island is covered in
about nine hundred rabbits.

2
00:00:04,479 --> 00:00:06,874
But it was once erased from
Japan's maps.

3
00:00:07,158 --> 00:00:11,814
From 1929 to 1945, the army secretly
made poison gas here.

4
00:00:11,978 --> 00:00:13,549
More than six thousand tons of it.

5
00:00:13,954 --> 00:00:16,569
Workers couldn't tell anyone,
not even their parents.

6
00:00:17,086 --> 00:00:20,211
Today, nobody agrees where
the rabbits came from.

7
00:00:20,261 --> 00:00:22,048
Some say they were test animals.

8
00:00:22,098 --> 00:00:25,503
Others say schoolchildren
released eight in 1971.

9
00:00:25,809 --> 00:00:27,402
So which story is true?
